    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned to draw on the power of the Shadowfell, gaining the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Darkness.</strong> You can expend 1 Focus Point to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDarkness00]{Darkness} without components. You can see within its area when you cast it this way, and while it lasts, you can move its area of Darkness to a space within 60 feet of you at the start of each of your turns.</p><p><strong>Darkvision.</strong> You gain Darkvision with a range of 60 feet; if you already have it, its range increases by 60 feet.</p><p><strong>Shadowy Figments.</strong> You know the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMinorIllus]{Minor Illusion} spell. Wisdom is your spellcasting ability for it.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-wr4OncoS7dzpL7Cc\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Spend the Focus Point with this activity, then cast Darkness from your sheet.</p></section>",
